Lots, I'm sure.  I personally don't bother throwing too many gems at
them -- I usually sacrifice enough to be at max luck.  Here are a few
ways I use to get next to them to kill them/throw them gems:

- Speed boots + intrinsic speed.  Then you'll be fast enough to get
  next to them occaisionally.  
- Let your pet attack them (they stop next to the pet to fight back,
  and then you can move next to them, and then throw a gem at them, 
  or attack them)
- Zap them with a wand reflected off a wall.  They try to stay out 
  of the direct path of a wand, but you can often reflect it off a 
  wall and hit them.  Maybe with a wand of sleep, you could just
  zap them, and then walk over and throw them a gem.
